{
    public static void Main()
    {
        Console.WriteLine("The universe's history is pieced together through various methods:");
        Console.WriteLine("1. Cosmic Microwave Background Radiation (CMB)");
        Console.WriteLine("2. Supernovae observations");
        Console.WriteLine("3. Hubble's Law");
        Console.WriteLine("4. Cosmic Inflation");
        Console.WriteLine("5. Dark Matter and Dark Energy");
        Console.WriteLine("6. Big Bang Theory");
    }
}
```

This function prints out the key methods used to understand the universe's history.

